---
// A single-turn call: the framework sends a system + user message list, the API returns one assistant message (redraw of Fig 2-2).
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 324"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-stc-title d2-stc-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-stc-title">Request and response of a single-turn API call</title>
	<desc id="d2-stc-desc">
		The request, constructed by the agent framework, holds two messages: a system message with rules written by the
		developer, and a user message, "Hello, who are you?". An arrow labelled Call leads to the response returned by
		the API, which holds one assistant message: the model-generated reply "Hi! I'm a coding assistant…". Each call is
		stateless, so all information needed by the model must be fully provided in the request's messages list.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d2-stc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Request and response of a single-turn API call</text>

	<g class="dg-container dg-harness">
		<rect x="6" y="44" width="320" height="214" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="22" y="74" font-weight="700">Request</text>
		<text x="22" y="98" class="dg-sub">constructed by the agent framework</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="22" y="112" width="288" height="60" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="166" y="137" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent dg-mono" font-weight="700">system</text>
		<text x="166" y="159" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Rules written by the developer</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-env">
		<rect x="22" y="182" width="288" height="60" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="166" y="207" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent dg-mono" font-weight="700">user</text>
		<text x="166" y="229" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">"Hello, who are you?"</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="326" y1="170" x2="392" y2="170" marker-end="url(#d2-stc-arrow)"></line>
		<text x="359" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-edge-label">Call</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-container dg-harness">
		<rect x="394" y="44" width="320" height="214" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="410" y="74" font-weight="700">Response</text>
		<text x="410" y="98" class="dg-sub">returned by the API</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="410" y="129" width="288" height="82" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="554" y="154" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent dg-mono" font-weight="700">assistant</text>
		<text x="554" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Model-generated reply</text>
		<text x="554" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">"Hi! I'm a coding assistant…"</text>
	</g>

	<text x="360" y="288" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Each call is stateless — all information needed by the model</text>
	<text x="360" y="310" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">must be fully provided in the request's messages list</text>
</svg>
